# Raw asset-pack downloads, at the REPO ROOT only. Only the converted, vendored
# copies under public/models/ belong in the repo; these are the originals they
# came from (see tools/obj-to-glb.mjs).
#
# The leading slash is load-bearing. Unanchored, `DeJunes/` matches a directory of
# that name at ANY depth — and Git's ignore matching is case-insensitive wherever
# core.ignorecase is on (the default on Windows and macOS), so it also swallowed
# the vendored `public/models/dejunes/`. Four catalogue entries load their models
# from there, so a fresh clone threw on the first car it tried to measure.
/Realistic Car Pack*/
/PSX_Style_Cars*/
/PSX_Style_Cars*.zip
/DeJunes/
/new_glb_carpacks_to_try/
